<p><mark>Brendan Ngwa Nforbi</mark> writes the Book of Brendan: a daily book of meditations on the Word of God, published at www.bookofbrendan.blog.</p>

<p>Every meditation on this site is written by Brendan Ngwa Nforbi. The pages, the dates, and the Scripture they sit with belong to this book and to this name.</p>

<p>These are not sermons. They are notes from the chair: short, dated, and meant to be lived. If a meditation helps you pray, that is enough.</p>

